orate and correspondent banking; and mortgage origination services. Further, it provides transaction processing services, credit card products, and sale of mutual funds. First Horizon Corporation was formerly known as First Horizon National Corporation and changed its name to First Horizon Corporation in April 2004. The company was founded in 1864 and is headquartered in Memphis, Tennessee."}}